9-62e702846358', 'word_count': 1132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44a02ee3-1c93-518d-a029-62e702846358'}, {'abstract': 'The House Judiciary Committee had been leading the debate over whether to impeach President Trump long before the Ukraine affair. This week, it returns to the center of the maelstrom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/01/us/politics/judiciary-trump-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'The House Judiciary Committee had been leading the debate over whether to impeach President Trump long before the Ukraine affair. This week, it returns to the center of the maelstrom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This spring, as President Trump defiantly rejected congressional attempts to investigate his conduct and policies, Representative Jerrold Nadler of New York, the chairman of the Judiciary Committee, asked his Democratic colleagues on his famously voluble panel a loaded question: When all is said and done, given the facts before us, are we heading toward impeaching this president? ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/us/politics/00dc-impeach1/merlin_160966500_8992cc16-9aae-4899-b9d5-a8e1c9468409-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/29/us/politics/00dc-impeach1/merlin_160966500_8992cc16-9aae-4899-b9d5-a8e1c9468409-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/us/politics/00dc-impeach1/merlin_160966500_8992cc16-9aae-4899-b9d5-a8e1c9468409-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/us/politics/00dc-impeach1/merlin_160966500_899