 p.m. on NBC. If you haven’t completed your holiday shopping yet, this craft competition show may inspire you to make your own gifts. The hosts Amy Poehler and Nick Offerman (“Parks and Recreation”) return for a second delightful season of creative exploration and craft puns. In this premiere, 10 contestants show off their making prowess by creating models of themselves as food items and reimagining their favorite inventions from their childhood. The judges Simon Doonan of Barneys and Dayna Isom Johnson of Etsy offer their expertise while Poehler and Offerman lighten the mood when the stress kicks in.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/02/arts/02tvcol-makingit/02tvcol-makingit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, 