6-2c38-5a1b-9bcb-87e28e58a5ba', 'word_count': 1611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6469be06-2c38-5a1b-9bcb-87e28e58a5ba'}, {'abstract': 'A famous movie heroine once called upon “a flock of sandwiches” to fuel her holiday soiree. You should, too.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/02/dining/party-sandwiches.html', 'snippet': 'A famous movie heroine once called upon “a flock of sandwiches” to fuel her holiday soiree. You should, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re a film buff, it’s impossible not to love the 1934 movie “The Thin Man,” which stars Myrna Loy, playing the part of Nora Charles, wife to William Powell’s Nick. Based on Dashiell Hammett’s crime novel of the same name, the movie follows the glamorous life of the couple as they pursue murder clues and drink a lot of martinis. During a raucous Christmas party, Nora picks up the phone, calls room service and utters one of cinema’s most memorable lines: “Send me up a whole flock of sandwiches!”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/dining/02Tanis1/merlin_164993532_f3b45631-e952-466d-8bf1-f2e45d12d1d5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/04/dining/02Tanis1/merlin_164993532_f3b45631-e952-466d-8bf1-f2e45d12d1d5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/dining/02Tanis1/merlin_164993532_f3b45631-e952-466d-8bf1-f2e45d12d1d5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/dining/02Tanis1/merlin_164993532_f3b45631-e952-466d-8bf1-f2e45d12d1d5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'wid