6'}, {'abstract': 'Democrats like the “optional” part of the so-called public option. But the very existence of new government insurance could shake up the system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/03/upshot/public-option-medicare-for-all.html', 'snippet': 'Democrats like the “optional” part of the so-called public option. But the very existence of new government insurance could shake up the system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The single-payer health plans proposed by Senators Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren are often assailed as being too disruptive. A government plan for everyone, the argument goes, would mean that tens of millions of Americans would have to give up health insurance they like.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/upshot/up-public-option2/merlin_164818953_5d1321be-9d45-4b42-a90c-213b8755229c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/25/upshot/up-public-option2/merlin_164818953_5d1321be-9d45-4b42-a90c-213b8755229c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/upshot/up-public-option2/merlin_164818953_5d1321be-9d45-4b42-a90c-213b8755229c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/upshot/up-public-option2/merlin_164818953_5d1321be-9d45-4b42-a90c-213b8755229c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/upshot/up-public-option2