a67-00ab-59ce-8b6c-b6e79ad56ca5'}, {'abstract': 'India’s Hindu nationalist turn and the ascendance of Islamophobic politics is reflected in the country’s films.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/03/opinion/bollywood-politics-india-modi.html', 'snippet': 'India’s Hindu nationalist turn and the ascendance of Islamophobic politics is reflected in the country’s films.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KOLKATA, India — With the election of Narendra Modi as the prime minister of India in 2014, I gained an identity that I hadn’t registered earlier: I am a Hindu meat eater. “When you slaughter an animal, then the color of its meat is pink. This is what they call a ‘Pink Revolution,’” Mr. Modi said at a rally leading up to his first election victory. “Across the countryside, our animals are getting slaughtered.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/03/opinion/03chattopadhyay/03chattopadhyay-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/03/opinion/03chattopadhyay/03chattopadhyay-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/03/opinion/03chattopadhyay/03chattopadhyay-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/03/opinion/03chattopadhyay/03chattopadhyay-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1340, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/03/opinion/03chattopadhyay/03chattopadhyay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name