 westerns, I didn’t expect the dubbing to be one of the best parts. It was.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/03/magazine/spaghetti-westerns-dubbing.html', 'snippet': 'When I decided to binge watch several dozen spaghetti westerns, I didn’t expect the dubbing to be one of the best parts. It was.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last winter, I decided it would be a good idea to watch several dozen spaghetti westerns over the course of approximately two months. The exercise originated as research for a book but soon settled into a soothing nightly ritual. I hadn’t realized the stress of scrolling through peak-streaming-era viewing options had been a stress at all, not until I deliberately limited myself to a minuscule subsection of the infinite menu. It practically felt like a mindfulness meditation.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-LOR-1/08Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-LOR-1/08Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-LOR-1/08Mag-LOR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-LOR-1/08Mag-LOR-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 972, 'width': 1441, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-LOR-1/08Mag-LOR-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro