d the couple’s 13-year-old daughter, Harriet. At a party that spring, he encountered the heiress and Anglo-Irish writer Caroline Blackwood. He moved into her house that night.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 955, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 955}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 644, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1287, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/04/books/03bookhardwick-lowell/03bookhardwick-lowell-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Dolphin Letters’ Shine Light on a Famous Marital and Literary S