_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e4d90c4-8ed9-5fe1-8ca1-86b11ef94770', 'word_count': 1220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e4d90c4-8ed9-5fe1-8ca1-86b11ef94770'}, {'abstract': 'I dropped out of film school to edit video for the conspiracy theorist because I believed in his worldview. Then I saw what it did to people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/05/magazine/alex-jones-infowars.html', 'snippet': 'I dropped out of film school to edit video for the conspiracy theorist because I believed in his worldview. Then I saw what it did to people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Election Day 2016, I sat in the passenger seat of Alex Jones’s Dodge Hellcat as we swerved through traffic, making our way to a nearby polling place. As Jones punched the gas pedal to the floor, the smell of vodka, like paint thinner, wafted up from the white Dixie cup anchored in the console. My stomach churned as the phone I held streamed live video to Facebook: Jones rambling about voter fraud and rigged elections while I stared at the screen, holding the camera at an angle to hide his double chin. It rarely worked, but I didn’t want to be blamed when he watched the video later.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '39', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 719}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 856, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1711, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/magazine/08Mag-Jones-1/08Mag-Jones-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I Worked for Alex Jones. I Regret It.', 'kicker': 'Feature', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. Jones and Me', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Infowars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Alex (1974- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Islamberg (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslim Americans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-05T10:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Owens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Owens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd5f4671-3587-5025-96f8-802a2a4b4463', 'word_count': 4505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd5f4671-3587-5025-96f8-802a2a4b4463'}, {'abstract': 'Is Midtown a place? Or a state of mind?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/05/magazine/judge-john-hodgman-on-where-midtown-ends.html', 'snippet': 'Is Midtown a place? Or a state of mind?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve writes: Most would agree that Midtown Manhattan ends at 59th Street, but where does it start? I just moved to the city a year ago, but to me, it seems that Midtown begins at 14th Street. My partner claims it’s 34th Street. Who is right?', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/02/12/magazine/Mag-Hodgman-1/Mag-Hodgman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre