ts/music/stephen-cleobury-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He led the King’s College Choir of England for 37 years, including during its famous Christmas Eve performances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stephen Cleobury, who for 37 years was music director at King’s College, Cambridge — which among other things meant he led one of the most beloved holiday musical events on the planet, the Christmas Eve performance by the college’s celebrated choir — died on Nov. 22 in York, England. He was 70.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/merlin_147660969_4cc450e5-44b3-4e9a-aad0-c5ba86b44f0f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/merlin_147660969_4cc450e5-44b3-4e9a-aad0-c5ba86b44f0f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/merlin_147660969_4cc450e5-44b3-4e9a-aad0-c5ba86b44f0f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/merlin_147660969_4cc450e5-44b3-4e9a-aad0-c5ba86b44f0f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/03Cleobury2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/06/obituaries/03Cleobury2/03Cleobury2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai