word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d41dab7a-ab1e-5b18-8641-bb81807aed16'}, {'abstract': 'Abu Zubaydah’s drawings of torture at the hands of American agents are a sickening reminder of what this country is capable of.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/05/opinion/cia-torture-drawings.html', 'snippet': 'Abu Zubaydah’s drawings of torture at the hands of American agents are a sickening reminder of what this country is capable of.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sketches should be seen only by adults, but they must be seen. Drawn by a victim of torture, they show, in raw and agonizing detail, the methods that Americans — soldiers, psychologists, spies, women and men — have devised to break down prisoners through pain, panic, brainwashing and other barbaric and illegal tools.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/opinion/05torture1-print/merlin_165433185_44cd863e-ed96-4810-8f10-5ac84c8d40f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/06/opinion/05torture1-print/merlin_165433185_44cd863e-ed96-4810-8f10-5ac84c8d40f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/opinion/05torture1-print/merlin_165433185_44cd863e-ed96-4810-8f10-5ac84c8d40f2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1021, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/06/opinion/05torture1-print/merlin_165433185_44cd863e-ed96-4810-8f10-5ac84c8d40f2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1021, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credi