ents to apply for my 2020 win-a-trip contest. I’ve been holding these contests since 2006, and taking the winner along with me on a reporting trip to cover global poverty and social justice issues. My aim is to generate interest in neglected topics and get more people writing about them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Win-a-Trip in 2020!', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Contests and Prizes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Center for Global Development', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kristof, Nicholas D', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-06T21:47:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c17d0921-3ae7-542d-a8a1-8ab90f802bec', 'word_count': 861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c17d0921-3ae7-542d-a8a1-8ab90f802bec'}, {'abstract': 'The fine print.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/06/opinion/win-a-trip-2020-contest-rules.html', 'snippet': 'The fine print.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NO PURCHASE NECESSARY. A PURCHASE OR PAYMENT OF ANY KIND WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Win-a-Trip With Nick Kristof’ 2020 Contest Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Contests and Prizes', 'rank': 1, 'm