lifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/111bd687-8d48-589e-ada3-33788d6babe2', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/111bd687-8d48-589e-ada3-33788d6babe2'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Sunday, Dec. 8, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/08/pageoneplus/corrections-dec-8-2019.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Sunday, Dec. 8, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article last Sunday about the slow rise of lesbianism on TV misstated which season of “Buffy the Vampire Slayer” featured a scene in which the characters Willow and Tara are shown in bed together. The scene occurred in the show’s sixth season, not its final season. The article also referred incorrectly to the scene. It was not the first lesbian sex scene shown on broadcast television; it showed the characters in bed together, but not engaged in sex. A later scene in that episode with the characters Willow and Kennedy was the first lesbian sex scene on broadcast television.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Dec. 8, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-12-08T06:11:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c88219a7-c515-50f3-bc10-c6308a2cb807', 'word_count': 614, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c88219a7-c515-50f3-bc10-c6308a2cb807'}, {'abstract': 'Firefighters were stymied by narrow alleys near where the blaze erupted, in a building used for making paper products and purses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/08/world/asia/india-new-delhi-fire.html', 'snippet': 'Firef