af57-becebb12dce9'}, {'abstract': 'Pan-roasted chicken in cream sauce, Indian-spiced tomato and egg casserole, a swordfish piccata: Make foods to comfort against the cold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/08/dining/what-to-cook-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'Pan-roasted chicken in cream sauce, Indian-spiced tomato and egg casserole, a swordfish piccata: Make foods to comfort against the cold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. No one I know loves winter more than Angie Mar, the chef and an owner of the Beatrice Inn in Manhattan. You could find some ski bum kid living the dream life in Durango, Colo., or Whitefish, Mont., or waking up each morning to praise the snow lords of Killington, Vt., a huge smile on his face, ready to shred. But he’s a depressive compared to Mar this time of year, when she’s cooking dinners of fats on fats, flavors on flavors, beautiful richness to reel the mind.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/magazine/06mag-eat/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/06/magazine/06mag-eat/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/magazine/06mag-eat/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/magazine/06mag-eat/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/magazine/06mag-eat/06mag-06eat-t_CA0