html', 'snippet': 'Maurizio Cattelan is more than a prankster, and “Comedian,” his potassium-rich latest work, is more than an overpriced piece of fruit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Art may be long, and life short, but the existence of a hand fruit is most ephemeral of all. This week at Art Basel Miami Beach, the art world’s premier Champagne-steeped swap meet, no work drew more grins, guffaws and selfies than a new sculpture by the semiretired Italian trickster Maurizio Cattelan: a banana duct-taped to the wall, its peel already speckled with brown spots. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1311, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/08/business/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-copy/08BANANA-CRITIC-01-