e eruption’s aftermath.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/08/world/asia/new-zealand-volcano-white-island.html', 'snippet': 'Rescuers were struggling to reach White Island, where conditions remained dangerous. The authorities said a criminal investigation had been opened in the eruption’s aftermath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHAKATANE, New Zealand — They had taken boats to a desolate island to get a glimpse of a natural wonder, but when the White Island volcano erupted on Monday,  a scene of stunning beauty suddenly turned into a deadly trap. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Eruption in New Zealand, 5 Dead, 8 Missing and ‘No Signs of Life’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Zealand Lists 5 Dead In Volcano’s  Sudden Blast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Volcanoes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'White Island (New Zealand)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ardern, Jacinda', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missing Persons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-09T04:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jamie Tarabay and Damien Cave', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jamie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tarabay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Damien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cave', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29f2883c-29db-534b-8541-314bbd29ee0c', 'word_count': 1358, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29f2883c-29db-534b-8541-314bbd29ee0c'}, {'abstract': 'While demanding that an opponent, Pete Buttigieg, disclose his McKinsey clients, Ms. Warren provided a fuller explanation of her compensation as a legal consultant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/08/us/politics/elizabeth-warren-legal-compensation.html', 'snippet': 'While demanding that an opponent, Pete Buttigieg, disclose his McKinsey clients, Ms. Warren provided a fuller explanation of her compensation as a legal consultant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Elizabeth Warren disclosed a detailed list of compensation she received during 30 years of moonlighting as a legal consultant — about $1.9 million in all — as she and Mayor Pete Buttigieg continued a back-and-forth demanding transparency in the race for the Democratic presidential nomination. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/us/politics/08warren-legal1/08warren-legal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/08/us/politics/08warren-legal1/08warren-legal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/us/politics/08warren-legal1/08warren-legal1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/us/politics/08warren-legal1/08warren-legal1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/08/us/pol