_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ef90975-da93-5890-b942-87d780c8c16f', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ef90975-da93-5890-b942-87d780c8c16f'}, {'abstract': 'At the House Judiciary Committee hearing, Democrats stuck to repeating the facts of their case as Republicans denounced impeachment as a misguided partisan process.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/09/us/politics/impeachment-hearings.html', 'snippet': 'At the House Judiciary Committee hearing, Democrats stuck to repeating the facts of their case as Republicans denounced impeachment as a misguided partisan process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Democrats and Republicans who squared off at Monday’s impeachment hearing in the House Judiciary Committee had one remarkable point of agreement: Both said that there are four key facts at the heart of the debate about whether President Trump should be impeached by the House and removed from office. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/09/nyregion/09dc-impeach-promo/merlin_165695310_79c00bce-e754-4d54-a3e5-17577d30914f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/09/nyregion/09dc-impeach-promo/merlin_165695310_79c00bce-e754-4d54-a3e5-17577d30914f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/09/nyregion/09dc-impeach-promo/merlin_165695310_79c00bce-e754-4d54-a3e5-17577d30914f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/09/nyregion/09dc-impeach-promo/merlin_165695310_79c00bce-e754-4d54-a3e5-17577d30914f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 's