 shop. The bright pink fun house called the Museum of Ice Cream opens in SoHo on Saturday. The entrance features a dipping counter where signature flavors like honey-swirled Queen Bee, crunchy Churro Churro and Malt Shake, with nubbins of malt balls, are scooped. Beyond, ticket holders will find three stories of ice cream installations, including a gallery of ice cream history and a speakeasy-style lounge where sundaes and shakes are served. Upstairs, there’s a room of bananas on strings, a space with secret doors, a pretend subway car and a stand for elastic Turkish ice cream. The lower level has the colorful sprinkles pool that the museum is known for and a big playroom with a tub full of cones. There are guides throughout to help.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09BurnerIce/09BurnerIce-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Museum of Ice Cream Returns With a Bigger Space', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Instagram: Museum of Ice Cream Is Back With More Space', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice Cream and Frozen Desserts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SoHo (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Museum of Ice Cream (Exhibit)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-10T03:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2066e9d-ed08-5531-8c5c-5d9d9cda463b', 'word_count': 170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2066e9d-ed08-5531-8c5c-5d9d9cda463b'}, {'abstract': 'A seasonal Mille Crêpes cake is topped with a glittering gelée made with bubbly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/09/dining/lady-m-cake-champagne.html', 'snippet': 'A seasonal Mille Crêpes cake is topped with a glittering gelée made with bubbly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pop the cork alongside a dessert like no other, from the kitchens of Lady M, the bakery founded in New York in 2001. It has infused its famous nine-inch multilayered Mille Crêpes cake with Champagne for the holidays. A whiff of strawberry enhances the pastry cream between the delicate layers and a shimmering Champagne gelée paves the top. The cake can be ordered whole for a party, or by the slice to eat on the spot.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner5/09burner5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lady M Adds Champagne to Its Signature Creation', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Celebrate: Lady M Adds Champagne To Its Signature Creation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Champagne (Wine)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cakes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LADY M CONFECTIONS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-10T03:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53016880-42f2-591c-9466-353f179a303e', 'word_count': 132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53016880-42f2-591c-9466-353f179a303e'}, {'abstract': 'D’Artagnan now sells a free-range turkey raised on scrap vegetables.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/09/dining/dartagnan-turkey.html', 'snippet': 'D’Artagnan now sells a free-range turkey raised on scrap vegetables.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, for the first time, D’Artagnan is selling turkeys, raised free range in Pennsylvania the same way as its Green Circle chickens, on scrap vegetables from food markets. The birds are grown to market weight more slowly than usual and air-chilled. I tried one for Thanksgiving without brining or heavy seasonings, roasted at 375 degrees for about 12 minutes per pound with a 30-minute resting period. The consensus was that it was very tasty, and the meaty breast was also quite moist. The turkeys are available throughout the holiday season.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner3/merlin_165330813_1851cc58-d4a0-4f46-a81d-1a35d10a3f6e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/09burner3/merlin_16