ticle/0ba26c6c-b4ac-530b-8840-a14db7761bc2'}, {'abstract': 'Drawing inspiration from Jewish Latinos, some cooks and bakers are making the sweet fritters for the holiday, instead of the traditional jelly doughnuts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/10/dining/churros-recipe-hanukkah.html', 'snippet': 'Drawing inspiration from Jewish Latinos, some cooks and bakers are making the sweet fritters for the holiday, instead of the traditional jelly doughnuts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Hanukkah this year, Zak Stern — who has been called the “kosher king” of Miami —\xa0is frying up doughnuts at Zak the Baker, his bakery and cafe. But he’s also making churros, the sweet fritter of choice in much of Latin America, Spain and Portugal.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/10churros1/merlin_165064092_907e7bc2-223d-4ff9-bee0-4ea02c72edd0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/10churros1/merlin_165064092_907e7bc2-223d-4ff9-bee0-4ea02c72edd0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/10churros1/merlin_165064092_907e7bc2-223d-4ff9-bee0-4ea02c72edd0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/10churros1/merlin_165064092_907e7bc2-223d-4ff9-bee0-4ea02c72edd0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/dining/10churros1/merlin