249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4c9d068-d6d0-592e-b3b4-16c27fa2b802'}, {'abstract': 'The administration’s food stamp cuts expose the cruel truth of Republican hypocrisy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/10/opinion/snap-food-stamps.html', 'snippet': 'The administration’s food stamp cuts expose the cruel truth of Republican hypocrisy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Trump administration is highly selective in how it applies the standard of “self-sufficiency” for programs. To move food stamp beneficiaries toward that goal in all states, Secretary of Agriculture Sonny Perdue laid out a plan to strengthen work requirements for federal beneficiaries by April 2020.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/10/opinion/10olmstead/10olmstead-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,