/12/10/arts/pop-culture-auction.html', 'snippet': 'Three auctions this month will give fans a chance to own collectibles from the world of comic books, television and film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’d like some comic book art, TV artifacts, or a little something from the movies, this may be your month as an array of pop culture memorabilia is coming to auction. The collectibles include original comics pages drawn by Steve Ditko and Will Eisner; television items like the frightening warrior doll from “Trilogy of Terror” and a jacket worn by the Fonz on “Happy Days”; and film props that include a motorcycle ridden by Tom Cruise in “Mission Impossible 2” and boxing trunks, stained with theatrical blood, worn by Sylvester Stallone in “Rocky III.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/10comics-auction-trek-kirk/10comics-auction-trek-kirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/10comics-auction-trek-kirk/10comics-auction-trek-kirk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 748}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/10comics-auction-trek-kirk/10comics-auction-trek-kirk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 822, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/10comics-auction-trek-kirk/10comics-auction-trek-kirk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1644, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/10comics-auction-trek-kirk/10comics-auction-trek-kirk-thu