ars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO — The Yankees have raised the stakes for their pursuit of another World Series title by acquiring Gerrit Cole, the top free-agent prize of this off-season, with the richest contract ever given to a pitcher: $324 million over nine years. The club had made Cole its overwhelming priority this off-season, ultimately beating the Los Angeles Angels and the Los Angeles Dodgers in the race for the right-hander. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/merlin_163147653_75a5d91e-078a-463b-b8bb-df567ab5e1c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/merlin_163147653_75a5d91e-078a-463b-b8bb-df567ab5e1c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/merlin_163147653_75a5d91e-078a-463b-b8bb-df567ab5e1c7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/merlin_163147653_75a5d91e-078a-463b-b8bb-df567ab5e1c7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/11cole-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/11cole-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11cole/11cole-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gerrit Cole and Yankees Agree to Record Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cole, Gerrit', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-11T05:26:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/05199426-aaca-53da-a94e-8fc415791285', 'word_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05199426-aaca-53da-a94e-8fc415791285'}, {'abstract': '“Michelle Wolf: Joke Show” debuts on Netflix. And a documentary about deafness airs on HBO.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/11/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday-a-michelle-wolf-special-and-moonlight-sonata.html', 'snippet': '“Michelle Wolf: Joke Show” debuts on Netflix. And a documentary about deafness airs on HBO.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MICHELLE WOLF: JOKE SHOW Stream on Netflix. “We can’t wait to hate people,” Michelle Wolf says in this, her latest stand-up special. “We can’t wait to have them canceled. And because of that, we get mad before we get logical.” She’s talking about a snarky reply she got to a social media post she made about otters (of all things), but the observation also addresses the reason many people now know who Wolf is: Last year, she was catapulted to national prominence after delivering a piercing monologue at the White House Correspondents’ Association Dinner. Some celebrated the routine. Some denounced it. Looking back on the evening in a recent interview with The New York Times, Wolf mentioned just one regret: “I would maybe go harder.” She presumably had more freedom to push boundaries in her streaming “Joke Show,” in which she addresses subjects like manspreading, gender equality and the physical fitness (or lack thereof) of some past presidents. “I say this all the time: Don’t bring your baggage into my joke,” Wolf said in the interview with The Times. “A comic’s job isn’t to be right or wrong. They’re just supposed to be funny.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow/11tvcol-michellewolfejokeshow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/1