tol, near the Welsh border, is emerging as a vibrant alternative to increasingly expensive London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This modern three-bedroom house is set on a hillside on the edge of Brockweir, a village in South West England about 25 minutes north of the city of Bristol. Designed by Loyn & Co Architects, a Welsh firm, for the current owners, who are artists, the single-story, concrete-and-glass home stretches horizontally across the landscape, providing sweeping views of the Wye Valley below.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/11/realestate/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH/11IHH-BRISTOL-slide-SBDH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7