 the SAG Awards, handed out by the Hollywood actors’ guild SAG-Aftra, always give us the most to chew over. This guild is comparable to the academy in terms of size and membership, and most of the five actors nominated in each individual category will go on to be nominated for Oscars, too. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/merlin_164288706_6f0933eb-8579-428d-a329-18e8a35fd7c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/merlin_164288706_6f0933eb-8579-428d-a329-18e8a35fd7c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/merlin_164288706_6f0933eb-8579-428d-a329-18e8a35fd7c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/merlin_164288706_6f0933eb-8579-428d-a329-18e8a35fd7c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1445, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/11sag-nominations2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/11sag-nominations2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/arts/11sag-nominations2/11sag-nominations2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width