se offered a bracing reality check.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/11/world/asia/daewoo-kim-woo-choong-obituary.html', 'snippet': 'The Daewoo founder’s mad-rush corporate expansion symbolized South Korea’s rise as an Asian tiger. Daewoo’s collapse offered a bracing reality check.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — Kim Woo-choong, whose catchphrase of “To the world, to the future!” inspired legions of young South Korean entrepreneurs after the devastation of the Korean War but whose mad-rush corporate expansion ended in the biggest bankruptcy in the country’s history, died on Monday night in Suwon, south of Seoul. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/obituaries/11kim-obit/merlin_165712878_c82fbcb1-473c-4751-9258-32dc1c5c06f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/12/obituaries/11kim-obit/merlin_165712878_c82fbcb1-473c-4751-9258-32dc1c5c06f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/obituaries/11kim-obit/merlin_165712878_c82fbcb1-473c-4751-9258-32dc1c5c06f0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/obituaries/11kim-obit/merlin_165712878_c82fbcb1-473c-4751-9258-32dc1c5c06f0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/obituaries/11kim-obit/11kim-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thu