buse. The justices examined whether that required a hearing in a trial court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/11/us/politics/supreme-court-arizona-death-penalty.html', 'snippet': 'An Arizona death row inmate was granted a new sentencing to consider evidence of childhood abuse. The justices examined whether that required a hearing in a trial court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court on Wednesday struggled to decide what kind of new sentencing an Arizona death row inmate was entitled to after a federal appeals court ruled that the trial judge who had condemned him to death failed to take account of evidence of abuse the inmate had endured as a child.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/us/politics/11dc-scotus/merlin_162317856_6694e1b8-8d0d-4e50-8d0a-e39c1848053b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/us/politics/11dc-scotus/merlin_162317856_6694e1b8-8d0d-4e50-8d0a-e39c1848053b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/us/politics/11dc-scotus/merlin_162317856_6694e1b8-8d0d-4e50-8d0a-e39c1848053b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/us/politics/11dc-scotus/merlin_162317856_6694e1b8-8d0d-4e50-8d0a-e39c1848053b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/us/politics/11dc-scotus/merlin_162317856_6694e1b8-8d0