url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/11/sports/basketball/nba-draft-alex-caruso-bryn-forbes.html', 'snippet': 'From Bryn Forbes of the Spurs to the cult hero Alex Caruso of the Lakers, many undrafted players are staking their claim in the league that shunned them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — Bryn Forbes spent his first year in the N.B.A. shuttling between San Antonio and Austin, Texas, in his 2010 Chevrolet Impala. He became very familiar with the 80-mile stretch of Interstate 35 that connects the two cities. Sometimes he played music. Sometimes he talked on the phone. Sometimes he drove in silence.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11nba-undrafted-lede/merlin_165423546_3248a360-80dd-41ab-b7f0-2248d78feeaa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11nba-undrafted-lede/merlin_165423546_3248a360-80dd-41ab-b7f0-2248d78feeaa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11nba-undrafted-lede/merlin_165423546_3248a360-80dd-41ab-b7f0-2248d78feeaa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11nba-undrafted-lede/merlin_165423546_3248a360-80dd-41ab-b7f0-2248d78feeaa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1489, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/11/sports/11nba-undrafted-lede/11nba-undrafted-lede-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't