s weigh heavily when examining the success of refinance applications.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/12/realestate/where-are-homeowners-successfully-refinancing.html', 'snippet': 'Home appreciation and credit scores weigh heavily when examining the success of refinance applications.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thirty-year fixed mortgage rates are low right now — about 3.68 percent as of the week of Dec. 5, down from a seven-year high of 4.94 percent in November 2018. On a $300,000 loan, the difference represents savings of about $220 a month, or nearly $80,000 over 30 years. Naturally, many homeowners might be asking themselves: “Should I refinance my mortgage?” perhaps followed by, “Will I be approved?”', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/realestate/12calculator-1575926065041/12calculator-1575926065041-articleLarge.png', 'height': 870, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/12/realestate/12calculator-1575926065041/12calculator-1575926065041-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 870}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/realestate/12calculator-1575926065041/12calculator-1575926065041-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 707, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/realestate/12calculator-1575926065041/12calculator-1575926065041-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1485, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/realestate/12calculator-1575926065041/12calculator-1575926065041-thumbS