n way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Teen-pop vocal acts — boy bands and girl groups — always have an alibi. The producer/manager/record company/Svengali made them do it. The other members outvoted them. It seemed smart or funny or commercial or harmless at the time. They were just kids. But a solo career demands more than big smiles, intertwined vocals, art-directed outfits and synchronized dance moves. It calls for something more personal, or at least more committed to a persona. The singer’s name is above the title; the buck stops there.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12styles-cabello/12styles-cabello-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '