terial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/954923d9-b97f-5f4e-abc6-3cfb191b716f', 'word_count': 715, 'uri': 'nyt://article/954923d9-b97f-5f4e-abc6-3cfb191b716f'}, {'abstract': 'Terrence Malick’s film telling the story of an Austrian farmer’s heroic defiance of the Nazis is gorgeous and at times frustrating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/12/movies/a-hidden-life-review.html', 'snippet': 'Terrence Malick’s film telling the story of an Austrian farmer’s heroic defiance of the Nazis is gorgeous and at times frustrating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Franz Jägerstätter, the Austrian farmer at the center of “A Hidden Life,” finds himself in a lot of arguments. He isn’t an especially contentious man — on the contrary, his manner is generally amiable and serene. But he has done something that people in his village and beyond find provocative, which is to refuse combat service in World War II. He won’t take the oath of loyalty to Adolf Hitler that is required of every Austrian soldier.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12hiddenlife1/merlin_165534831_f98ad7a7-772a-4da3-95ca-9f9eaa4ba50d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12hiddenlife1/merlin_165534831_f98ad7a7-772a-4da3-95ca-9f9eaa4ba50d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12hiddenlife1/merlin_165534831_f98ad7a7-772a-4da3-95ca-9f9eaa4ba50d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/12/arts/12hiddenlife1/merlin_165534831_f98ad7a7-772a-4da3-95ca-9f9eaa4