nd Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corbyn, Jeremy (1949- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-13T03:37:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Brooks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4ddb067-47fd-509f-ba1b-2c968a1072ef', 'word_count': 904, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4ddb067-47fd-509f-ba1b-2c968a1072ef'}, {'abstract': 'Avoid the murky waters of trolldom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/12/smarter-living/how-to-argue-on-the-internet-without-losing-your-mind.html', 'snippet': 'Avoid the murky waters of trolldom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Behind the wheel of her car, a friend of mine turns into an entirely different person. While driving, she shouts expletives and flips fingers at anyone she deems deserving. In person, however, she’s the type who apologizes profusely for bumping into strangers and, even when she’s extremely upset, will only softly mumble “frick it” under her breath. Sometimes it’s hard to believe this is the same person, but she’s not alone. Road rage is common, partly because our cars grant us a degree of anonymity, which can turn us into jerks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/13/smarter-living/13sl-argueonline-promo/13sl-argueonline-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Argue on the Internet Without Losing Your Mind', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to Argue Amid Trolldom', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subje