 Movement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capitalism (Theory and Philosophy)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Redeemer Presbyterian Church', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keller, Timothy J (1950- )', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bible', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jesus Christ', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-13T16:50:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Molly Worthen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Molly', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Worthen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/05f565a8-dd8f-5c0a-a1e8-aa956fb58ecd', 'word_count': 2465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05f565a8-dd8f-5c0a-a1e8-aa956fb58ecd'}, {'abstract': 'While Ms. Warren remains a leading candidate, her momentum has slowed in part because she faces threats from both the left and the right.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/13/us/politics/latest-democratic-polls-elizabeth-warren.html', 'snippet': 'While Ms. Warren remains a leading candidate, her momentum has slowed in part because she faces threats from both the left and the right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome to Poll Watch, our weekly look at polling data and survey research on the candidates, voters and issues that will shape the 2020 election.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'