, including “The Irishman.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/13/movies/jerry-vale-the-irishman.html', 'snippet': 'The singer’s easy-listening hits were fixtures in the director’s household growing up and have figured in several of his movies, including “The Irishman.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a typical Sunday afternoon when the director Martin Scorsese was growing up on Elizabeth Street in the Little Italy neighborhood of New York, the family apartment was filled with both the aroma of a simmering sauce and music from the popular Italian-American crooners of the day. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 323, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 323}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1104, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/17/arts/13irishman-music-new2/13irishman-music-new-02-thumbStandard.jpg