rday about whether they could commit, just on paper, to raise voluntary climate targets next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — After two weeks of contentious negotiations, world leaders put in charge of averting a cluster of accelerating climate threats remained at loggerheads late Saturday about whether they could commit, just on paper, to raise voluntary climate targets next year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/merlin_165793023_f3568ab3-6cf8-480a-bc0a-3ea92fb6aeb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/merlin_165793023_f3568ab3-6cf8-480a-bc0a-3ea92fb6aeb2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/merlin_165793023_f3568ab3-6cf8-480a-bc0a-3ea92fb6aeb2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/merlin_165793023_f3568ab3-6cf8-480a-bc0a-3ea92fb6aeb2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/14CLI-DIPLO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/14/climate/14CLI-DIPLO1/14CLI-DIPLO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',