': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/3448a7cc-e8de-50d6-957d-d013dfe41419', 'word_count': 1069, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3448a7cc-e8de-50d6-957d-d013dfe41419'}, {'abstract': 'It’s not the offense, but rather one party’s rejection of reality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/14/opinion/sunday/republicans-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'It’s not the offense, but rather one party’s rejection of reality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republicans argue that the present impeachment process is nothing like Watergate. At that time there was growing bipartisan alarm at President Richard Nixon’s conduct, while the impeachment votes on Friday in the House Judiciary Committee were strictly along party lines.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/15kristof/merlin_165861666_97c7e836-bdb0-46bf-b7f9-59048e1edb6e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/15kristof/merlin_165861666_97c7e836-bdb0-46bf-b7f9-59048e1edb6e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/15kristof/merlin_165861666_97c7e836-bdb0-46bf-b7f9-59048e1edb6e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/15kristof/merlin_165861666_97c7e836-bdb0-46bf-b7f9-59048e1edb6e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/op