organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/03304dbb-00fe-59ab-a53a-7098395e50e6', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03304dbb-00fe-59ab-a53a-7098395e50e6'}, {'abstract': 'Sometimes I wonder if I can stand many more years of unreliable service. Then something happens that gets me all mushy again.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/14/opinion/sunday/new-york-subway.html', 'snippet': 'Sometimes I wonder if I can stand many more years of unreliable service. Then something happens that gets me all mushy again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like any good New Yorker, I mind my own business on the subway. Unless I’m in a bad mood, like that cold day last week when nobody was emailing me back, and my jeans were too tight, and I was late for a meeting I didn’t want to go to and this kid turned his profane rap music up to full volume on the platform. Black and brown teenagers are often overpoliced in public spaces, but this kid was as white as Post Malone.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/15/opinion/sunday/15higgins/15higgins-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/15/opinion/sunday/15higgins/15higgins-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/15/opinion/sunday/15higgins/15higgins-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/15/opinion/sunday/15higgins/15higgins-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy':