ld the enduring instrumental hit “Pop Corn,” among many other works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gershon Kingsley, a composer who brought electronic sounds into popular music and wrote the enduring instrumental hit “Pop Corn,”  died on Dec. 10 at his home in Manhattan. He was 97.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/merlin_165809496_d081dde1-8135-49c7-b0fe-ce7c08749731-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/merlin_165809496_d081dde1-8135-49c7-b0fe-ce7c08749731-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/merlin_165809496_d081dde1-8135-49c7-b0fe-ce7c08749731-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/merlin_165809496_d081dde1-8135-49c7-b0fe-ce7c08749731-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/15Kingsleyobit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/15Kingsleyobit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/obituaries/15Kingsleyobit1/15Kingsleyobit1-th