ars older, taught him how to do the Lindy hop. They’d practice the eight-count step late at night, big band swing notes at 78 r.p.m. filling the rooms of their home in Jamaica, Queens.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Was Lost in ‘the Last Good War’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What Was Lost in ‘The Last Good War’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Letters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-15T22:32:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma Goldberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b33af25-32f1-5227-b9d2-6a483b49ffc1', 'word_count': 1030, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b33af25-32f1-5227-b9d2-6a483b49ffc1'}, {'abstract': 'Get off the shelf and have some fun with Howard Barkin and Kevin Christian’s Monday puzzle!', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/15/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2019-12-16.html', 'snippet': 'Get off the shelf and have some fun with Howard Barkin and Kevin Christian’s Monday puzzle!', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONDAY PUZZLE — Aah, a nice new week, a fresh start, a Monday puzzle, something we can actually feel confident about. Two congenial constructors, one a familiar weekender, Howard Barkin, and one a Monday regular, Kevin Christian. Three theme answers, check; some interesting cultural touchpoints, check; a dip into modern vernacular (by way of two debuts), check. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images