': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7b8edc2-ca30-5340-9e71-455cea563457', 'word_count': 1179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7b8edc2-ca30-5340-9e71-455cea563457'}, {'abstract': 'It’s a huge undertaking to slow climate change, but we’ve done big things before.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/16/opinion/climate-change-grid.html', 'snippet': 'It’s a huge undertaking to slow climate change, but we’ve done big things before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Decades of climate change foot-dragging are finally giving way to public demands for action. Around the world, millions of young people are on the march. Political and business leaders are making pledges and offering plans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/16gillis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/16gillis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 754}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/16gillis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 815, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/16gillis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1630, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/16gillis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/17/opinion/16gillis/