/www.nytimes.com/2019/12/16/opinion/FBI-Trump-russia-investigation.html', 'snippet': 'The rule of law is the principle that protects every American from the abuse of monarchs, despots and tyrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The privilege of being the only American in our history to serve as the director of both the F.B.I. and the C.I.A. gives me a unique perspective and a responsibility to speak out about a dire threat to the rule of law in the country I love. Order protects liberty, and liberty protects order. Today, the integrity of the institutions that protect our civil order is, tragically, under assault from too many people whose job it should be to protect them.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/16webster/merlin_163910355_fa50244e-1882-4add-bad1-ea314264bba0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/16webster/merlin_163910355_fa50244e-1882-4add-bad1-ea314264bba0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/16webster/merlin_163910355_fa50244e-1882-4add-bad1-ea314264bba0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/16webster/merlin_163910355_fa50244e-1882-4add-bad1-ea314264bba0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/opinion/16webster/merlin_163910355_fa50244e-1882-4add-bad1-ea314264bba0-thumbStandard.jpg', '