e, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Serie A (Italian Soccer League)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lukaku, Romelu (1993- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Balotelli, Mario', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fugazzotto, Simone', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-16T19:13:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rory Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6d2ea22-69a1-5444-a10f-5b44d8ea7865', 'word_count': 772, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6d2ea22-69a1-5444-a10f-5b44d8ea7865'}, {'abstract': 'New tasting kits from Olive Oil Jones offer the chance to explore European oils and vinegars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/16/dining/olive-oil-jones-tasting-kits.html', 'snippet': 'New tasting kits from Olive Oil Jones offer the chance to explore European oils and vinegars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Olive Oil Jones, which imports oils and vinegars directly from their producers, has introduced tasting kits. Each well-priced box ($65) has four bottles of oil or vinegar, a varied assortment to explore. The oils are Catalan arbequina, Spanish Sierra de Cazorla, Portuguese Cabeço das Nogueiras and Western Sicilian. The vinegar kit has lambrusco, saba, bittersweet riesling and balsamic from Modena. Olive Oil Jones is co-owned by Steven Jenkins, a former partner in the Fairway grocery chain.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 744, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1487, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16burner-kit/16burner-kit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Olive Oil Adventure Awaits', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Sample: Dress Your Tastebuds In These Oils and Vinegars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vinegar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oils and Fats', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Olive Oil Jones', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jenkins, Steven W', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-16T19:15:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56e2d7d3-8591-5018-9dc4-6b2738438d0e', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56e2d7d3-8591-5018-9dc4-6b2738438d0e'}, {'abstract': 'A sprawling Coffee Project NY space in Queens will hold certification classes for coffee lovers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/16/dining/coffee-project-ny-queens.html', 'snippet': 'A sprawling Coffee Project NY space in Queens will hold certification classes for coffee lovers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cafes that are serious about the coffees they prepare have become commonplace. But here’s a new one that’s also a school and a training ground for baristas, with rigorous courses leading to official certification by the Specialty Coffee Association, a global trade group. Chi Sum Ngai and Kaleena Teoh, who own Coffee Project NY cafes in the East Village and Fort Greene, Brooklyn, have opened an ambitious new Queens flagship in part to fill a gap. “The Specialty Coffee Association has labs worldwide but none in New York,” said Ms. Ngai, who said she had to fly to Gainesville, Fla., to earn her certification. Recreational classes are also offered in the lab’s spacious classroom. The huge roaster in the front room is the top of the line; Ms. Ngai likes it because it’s not fully automated so she can control the settings. There is an informal cafe where a wide variety of coffees are brewed in myriad styles. Sandwiches and some pastries are served.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/merlin_165853137_01571beb-77c8-4a3c-b4bf-434b836eaf52-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/merlin_165853137_01571beb-77c8-4a3c-b4bf-434b836eaf52-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/merlin_165853137_01571beb-77c8-4a3c-b4bf-434b836eaf52-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/merlin_165853137_01571beb-77c8-4a3c-b4bf-434b836eaf52-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/16BurnerCoffee-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/16BurnerCoffee-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/dining/16BurnerCoffee/16BurnerCoffee-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thi