s That Influence the Way We Design, we expected that it would strike a nerve: definitive lists of this sort always tend to engender passionate feedback — and who among us hasn’t seen a space that’s remained in our mind’s eye, influencing not only how we see, but how we live (or, at least, would like to live)? With that in mind, we looked through comments on the article and T’s Instagram account to find some more rooms that readers themselves would have included. From Frank Lloyd Wright’s handsome midcentury homes to choices that reflect the paucity of women and non-American designers on our original list, here are some of the most popular selections.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/t-magazine/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/16/t-magazine/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/t-magazine/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/t-magazine/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/16/t-magazine/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69/00tmag-morerooms-slide-3G69-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',