nk': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RT (TV Network)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Russkaya Vesna', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markiv, Vitaly', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-17T18:59:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Momigliano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Momigliano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc5e0c09-d3a9-5755-bb41-e9e71aa3d38f', 'word_count': 1234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc5e0c09-d3a9-5755-bb41-e9e71aa3d38f'}, {'abstract': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/17/style/tiny-modern-love-stories-the-chart-said-breakup-so-we-did.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a geneticist. At a conference where I was presenting, I spit into a tube for one of those DNA tests that are now all the craze. How fitting but surprising to discover not one but six half-siblings. I grew up with one full sister. Our parents, now deceased, never mentioned a sperm donor. I suppose that’s how they quietly managed infertility in the 1950s. Although I was initially incredulous, I delight in the fact that, more than half a century ago, an anonymous man from Brooklyn gave us the gift of life and, years later, each other. — Ricki Lewis', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'captio