 'word_count': 1261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad817b60-ec75-5326-823a-61fb49af4fb6'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans of courage and conscience ought to join the Democrats who cast their votes for impeachment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/18/opinion/steny-hoyer-trump-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans of courage and conscience ought to join the Democrats who cast their votes for impeachment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the framers of our Constitution laid out the process of impeachment in 1787, they could hardly imagine the circumstances that brought us to this week’s vote in the House. With the combination of a telephone call soliciting foreign interference in our election, the hiding of that call’s summary on a special computer server and a barrage of presidential tweets denying any quid pro quo, it’s easy to imagine Alexander Hamilton, James Madison and John Jay scratching their heads. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/opinion/18Hoyer/18Hoyer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/18/opinion/18Hoyer/18Hoyer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/opinion/18Hoyer/18Hoyer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/opinion/18Hoyer/18Hoyer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/opinion/18Hoyer/18Hoyer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 