cend on New York more reliably than snow. Whatever the strengths and flaws of each, you can usually depend on the music to be great. That’s true of the original Tchaikovsky score, of course, but also of the 1960 jazz arrangement by Duke Ellington and Billy Strayhorn that Dorrance Dance uses in its new take that premiered at the Joyce Theater on Tuesday evening.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/19/arts/18dorrance/merlin_166114068_921451f9-dd8d-4c7c-b693-0f78e50a968f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred