s.html', 'snippet': 'Long after their days in workshops and graduate seminars have ended, some authors still find support and inspiration in writing groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jenny Zhang was in sweatpants, wrestling one Sunday afternoon with a short story that wasn’t coming together. She typed out an email to seven other writers: “Yo. Can we meet up next week? I have something that I kinda semi-urently” — the g key on her keyboard was broken — “need help on.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/merlin_163058916_b631e5af-6979-4594-856c-500aac46d676-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/merlin_163058916_b631e5af-6979-4594-856c-500aac46d676-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/merlin_163058916_b631e5af-6979-4594-856c-500aac46d676-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/merlin_163058916_b631e5af-6979-4594-856c-500aac46d676-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/00Writersgroups1-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/20/books/00Writersgroups1-sub/00Writersgroups1-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 't