ool collector’s apartment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/19/style/loewe-opens-a-store.html', 'snippet': 'Think of it as a cool collector’s apartment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Loewe looks as if it’s pronounced like Lowe’s, the home improvement store, but it is triple syllabic, Lo-Way-Vay. The company, based in Madrid, is now in its 174th year, and its new store, on Greene Street in SoHo, is its first in New York. Originally a collective of leather craftsmen, the house expanded in 2013, when Jonathan Anderson was named creative director, and has since gained fashion (and presumably financial) traction. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/fashion/18CRITIC-LOEWE-1/merlin_165850431_a9d66df6-26f5-43c8-9afc-813680ad8223-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/19/fashion/18CRITIC-LOEWE-1/merlin_165850431_a9d66df6-26f5-43c8-9afc-813680ad8223-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/fashion/18CRITIC-LOEWE-1/merlin_165850431_a9d66df6-26f5-43c8-9afc-813680ad8223-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/fashion/18CRITIC-LOEWE-1/merlin_165850431_a9d66df6-26f5-43c8-9afc-813680ad8223-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/19/fashion/18CRITIC-LOEWE-1/18CRITIC-LOEWE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_