he bright magic of raising my son, it felt as if I had to pay a price: My awareness of the darkness increased.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/20/well/family/finding-light-at-the-darkest-time-of-the-year.html', 'snippet': 'To experience the bright magic of raising my son, it felt as if I had to pay a price: My awareness of the darkness increased.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was in the parking lot of the tree farm that I watched my son’s little feet walk ahead of me and thought to myself, this is what it feels like to get what you want. My whole world wrapped up in two people: my husband prepping the truck for the tree, and our son’s mitten-free hands reaching out for fir branches and pebbles. My son, a toddler, finds the small things that would go unnoticed, and in turn my life has become a series of minutes where something incredible happens. Over and over, for a year and a half, discovery, delight, repeat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/science/00TIESSAD/00TIESSAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/18/science/00TIESSAD/00TIESSAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/science/00TIESSAD/00TIESSAD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/science/00TIESSAD/00TIESSAD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/18/science/00TIESSAD/00TIESSAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he