nk': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alonzo-Gomez, Felipe (d 2018)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caal Maquin, Jakelin (d 2018)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central America', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guatemala', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Mexico', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-21T05:08:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aimee Ortiz and Michael Levenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aimee', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ortiz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Levenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46ced45c-dd34-5949-b0a1-028345860664', 'word_count': 703, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46ced45c-dd34-5949-b0a1-028345860664'}, {'abstract': 'Dan Krauss’s war drama arrives on Amazon, and “The Santa Clause” film series airs on Freeform.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/21/arts/television/whats-on-tv-saturday-the-kill-team-and-the-santa-clause.html', 'snippet': 'Dan Krauss’s war drama arrives on Amazon, and “The Santa Clause” film series airs on Freeform.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE KILL TEAM (2019) Stream on Amazon; rent on Amazon or Vudu. The director Dan Krauss revisits the case at the center of his 2014 documentary “The Kill Team” in this war drama. Andrew (Nat Wolff), a young American soldier in Afghanistan, starts his deployment with fortitude. But after he witnesses fellow recruits kill innocent Afghan civilians, he second-guesses his brigade’s mission and considers reporting their behavior. What stops him, though, is a terrifying sergeant (Alexander Skarsgard) and the possibility that Andrew’s fellow soldiers would kill him, too. “Dramatizing these events makes them seem isolated — a bad-apples incident,” Ben Kenigsberg wrote in his New York Times review. “The documentary had a more haunting implication: If you train soldiers for Hollywood-ready combat, violence on peacekeeping missions becomes inevitable.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/merlin_162980199_ca052c1b-d9bb-46ca-8b6a-5c05fc873676-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/merlin_162980199_ca052c1b-d9bb-46ca-8b6a-5c05fc873676-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/merlin_162980199_ca052c1b-d9bb-46ca-8b6a-5c05fc873676-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/merlin_162980199_ca052c1b-d9bb-46ca-8b6a-5c05fc873676-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/21tvcol-killteam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/21/arts/21tvcol-killteam/21tvcol-killteam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei