Mad Men” workplaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/22/business/media/ad-industry-sexism.html', 'snippet': 'Campaigns promoting female empowerment are all the rage. But women in advertising say they still have to navigate “Mad Men” workplaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The empowerment of women was a major theme of Advertising Week, a yearly gathering of roughly 100,000 ad-industry people in New York. The female R&B group TLC kicked off the program with a concert called “Future Is Female,” and there were panel discussions with titles like “Mom Bosses,” “#RewriteHerStory” and “Time’s Up, Pay Up: We Will Not Wait 100 Years.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/business/00ADSEXISM-01/merlin_163289541_4561a3f0-9d6d-4fb7-82dc-e1d7c0cc1ff8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/05/business/00ADSEXISM-01/merlin_163289541_4561a3f0-9d6d-4fb7-82dc-e1d7c0cc1ff8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/business/00ADSEXISM-01/merlin_163289541_4561a3f0-9d6d-4fb7-82dc-e1d7c0cc1ff8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/business/00ADSEXISM-01/merlin_163289541_4561a3f0-9d6d-4fb7-82dc-e1d7c0cc1ff8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/business/00ADSEXISM-01/00ADSEXISM-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'