The fantasy series based on novels by Philip Pullman wraps up its first season. And rivals clash on Monday Night Football.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/23/arts/television/whats-on-tv-monday-his-dark-materials-and-a-football-finale.html', 'snippet': 'The fantasy series based on novels by Philip Pullman wraps up its first season. And rivals clash on Monday Night Football.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREEN BAY PACKERS VS. MINNESOTA VIKINGS 8:15 p.m. on ESPN. The two teams at the top of the N.F.C. North meet in Minneapolis in the final Monday Night Football game of the year. The Minnesota Vikings haven’t lost at home all season and have never lost to the Packers at U.S. Bank Stadium but they trail their regional rivals in the standings. They were also defeated in an earlier matchup at Lambeau Field in September. With the regular season just two games away from completion there’s still plenty to fight for. The Vikings have yet to clinch a playoff spot and the Packers are competing for postseason privileges. Minnesota fans may be hoping that the Vikings’s offensive edge and passionate home support will be enough to avoid a regular season series sweep.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/arts/23tvcol-1/merlin_160873377_6ccfd4ce-7569-4309-a2b4-c941f49fb2ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/23/arts/23tvcol-1/merlin_160873377_6ccfd4ce-7569-4309-a2b4-c941f49fb2ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/arts/23tvcol-1/merlin_160873377_6ccfd4ce-7569-4309-a2b4-c941f49fb2ad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '