, and read more about, our favorite interiors from 2019.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1209, 'width': 1813, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/26/t-magazine/30tmag-2019interiors-trancoso/26tmag-trancoso-slide-NMEV-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The 17 Most Extraordinary Homes Featured in T This Year', 'kicker': 'T’s Best of 2019', 'content_kicke