 'uri': 'nyt://article/3308631c-e7b9-59df-af69-f51f3348792b'}, {'abstract': 'Baby Yoda is a productivity metaphor, O.K. Boomer can be tied to homeownership and hemp farming is an outgrowth of the trade war.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/23/business/economy/2019-economy.html', 'snippet': 'Baby Yoda is a productivity metaphor, O.K. Boomer can be tied to homeownership and hemp farming is an outgrowth of the trade war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — America made some memories in 2019. Taylor Swift told us all to calm down, Aunt Becky was accused of cheating to get her daughters into college and a Facebook meme prompted hordes of people — and zero aliens — to trek out to a town near Area 51. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/business/23DC-SOCIALECON-01/merlin_165673722_861b0587-1e68-4282-b5e6-7b93a9a4f55a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 283, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/23/business/23DC-SOCIALECON-01/merlin_165673722_861b0587-1e68-4282-b5e6-7b93a9a4f55a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 283}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/business/23DC-SOCIALECON-01/merlin_165673722_861b0587-1e68-4282-b5e6-7b93a9a4f55a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/business/23DC-SOCIALECON-01/merlin_165673722_861b0587-1e68-4282-b5e6-7b93a9a4f55a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 964, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/23/business/23