 couple of holiday movies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/24/arts/television/whats-on-tv-tuesday-john-mulaney-and-christmas-classics.html', 'snippet': 'Catch John Mulaney in a new children’s special on Netflix, or celebrate Christmas Eve with a couple of holiday movies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JOHN MULANEY & THE SACK LUNCH BUNCH (2019) Stream on Netflix. John Mulaney channels his inner Mister Rogers in this new children’s variety special, which he describes as “a show for kids, by adults, with kids present.” The comedian and the Sack Lunch Bunch, a group of children ages 8 to 13, share their biggest fears and tell odd stories in talking head interviews, variety sketches and elaborate musical numbers, including “I Saw a White Lady Standing on the Street Sobbing” and “Grandma’s Boyfriend Paul.” A number of guest stars join the fun, among them David Byrne, Natasha Lyonne and Jake Gyllenhaal, who plays a manic, mustachioed entertainer called Mr. Music. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/24/arts/24tvcol-john/24tvcol-john-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/24/arts/24tvcol-john/24tvcol-john-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/24/arts/24tvcol-john/24tvcol-john-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/24/arts/24tvcol-john/24tvcol-john-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non