9/12/26/style/2019-style-photos.html', 'snippet': 'America is lonely, unequal and worried. Also maybe needs a snack and a nap. Styles photographers went out to identify magic, anxiety and transformation in 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s very nearly 2020, an election year in the United States, and by the look of the country on TV and in the newspapers, you’d think every day was spent in bitter acrimony over health care and environmental catastrophe, financial inequality and discussing if we all work for Mark Zuckerberg and Jeff Bezos.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Happening to Us? A Visual History of 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-selfcare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-12-26T14:38:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ea1e917-6e94-57c9-81ec-62f01dc10958', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ea1e917-6e94-57c9-81ec-62f01dc10958'}, {'abstract': 'A retail survey showed an 18.8 percent rise in online shopping. Consumer confidence has been bolstered this year by a low unemployment rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/26/business/economy/holiday-consumer-spending.html', 'snippet': 'A retail survey showed an 18.8 percent rise in online shopping. Consumer confidence has been bolstered this year by a low unemployment rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Americans keep spending, driving the economy at a time when unemployment is at a half-century low point despite headwinds from the trade war. 