50-e717b76fef52'}, {'abstract': 'The new Russian weapon system flies at superfast speeds and can evade traditional missile defense systems. The United States is trying to catch up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/12/27/us/politics/russia-hypersonic-weapon.html', 'snippet': 'The new Russian weapon system flies at superfast speeds and can evade traditional missile defense systems. The United States is trying to catch up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Russian military on Friday said it had deployed a hypersonic weapon that flies at superfast speeds and can easily evade American missile defense systems, potentially setting off a new chapter in the long arms race between the world’s pre-eminent nuclear powers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/27/us/politics/27dc-missile1/merlin_148502565_935d86cd-f5eb-4932-9d85-8c1a14c365a9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/27/us/politics/27dc-missile1/merlin_148502565_935d86cd-f5eb-4932-9d85-8c1a14c365a9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/27/us/politics/27dc-missile1/merlin_148502565_935d86cd-f5eb-4932-9d85-8c1a14c365a9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/27/us/politics/27dc-missile1/merlin_148502565_935d86cd-f5eb-4932-9d85-8c1a14c365a9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/27/